    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Neko Caf\u00e9 Stories</strong>, a cozy and relaxing bubble merge puzzle game set in a stylish anime caf\u00e9 run by charming neko girls. Match and merge colorful sweets to unlock new characters and progress through fun, dessert-themed challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>At the heart of the game is a satisfying <strong>bubble merge mechanic</strong> \u2014 drag and combine matching sweets on the puzzle board to create new ones, complete level objectives, and earn delicious cakes.<br>Every few levels, a new character is revealed, adding variety and charm to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, elegant caf\u00e9 managed by unique anime-style neko girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>9 different girls</strong>, each unlocked by completing 3 bubble merge puzzle levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and rewarding merging system with clever layouts and gameplay twists like portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn anime visuals with polished details and soothing background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through relaxing levels and enjoy visually delightful rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of laid-back puzzle games with merging mechanics, cute character design, and a relaxing vibe, <strong>Neko Caf\u00e9 Stories</strong> is your perfect treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/3d259c8e5bca9b0bb423e6b2dea27ce5.poster.avif?t=1754379527\" width=500 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/3d259c8e5bca9b0bb423e6b2dea27ce5.webm?t=1754379527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the pouring rain, you find shelter in a mysterious caf\u00e9 where catgirls work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of them has her own story, and you are a random guest who might stay here for a long time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/3b0277de6e873f3e070e8a127cb46d97.poster.avif?t=1754379527\" width=500 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/3b0277de6e873f3e070e8a127cb46d97.webm?t=1754379527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Neko Caf\u00e9 Stories</strong>, a cozy and relaxing bubble merge puzzle game set in a stylish anime caf\u00e9 run by charming neko girls. Match and merge colorful sweets to unlock new characters and progress through fun, dessert-themed challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf70 <strong>Core Gameplay</strong><br>At the heart of the game is a satisfying <strong>bubble merge mechanic</strong> \u2014 drag and combine matching sweets on the puzzle board to create new ones, complete level objectives, and earn delicious cakes.<br>Every few levels, a new character is revealed, adding variety and charm to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single, elegant caf\u00e9 managed by unique anime-style neko girls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>9 different girls</strong>, each unlocked by completing 3 bubble merge puzzle levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and rewarding merging system with clever layouts and gameplay twists like portals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn anime visuals with polished details and soothing background music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through relaxing levels and enjoy visually delightful rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're a fan of laid-back puzzle games with merging mechanics, cute character design, and a relaxing vibe, <strong>Neko Caf\u00e9 Stories</strong> is your perfect treat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/3d259c8e5bca9b0bb423e6b2dea27ce5.poster.avif?t=1754379527\" width=500 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/3d259c8e5bca9b0bb423e6b2dea27ce5.webm?t=1754379527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the pouring rain, you find shelter in a mysterious caf\u00e9 where catgirls work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of them has her own story, and you are a random guest who might stay here for a long time...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/3b0277de6e873f3e070e8a127cb46d97.poster.avif?t=1754379527\" width=500 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765830/extras/3b0277de6e873f3e070e8a127cb46d97.webm?t=1754379527\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
